 "outro": "The lock cycles. Behind you the wrecks turn slowly in the dark, three of forty-one.",
 "messages": [
  {
   "id": "start",
   "at": [10, 12],
   "radius": 3,
   "speaker": "SIGNAL HOUSE",
   "text": "Calder, the Wreck Belt: wrecks of earlier invasions. Step on a lit plate and it throws you across the gap. Steer a little, shoot as you go. If you miss, the sky puts you back."
  },
  {
   "id": "break",
   "at": [31, 14],
   "radius": 3,
   "speaker": "INES",
   "text": "Six cells of nothing. The plate is at the end of the deck. If this is wrong it costs fifteen."
