   "at": [58, 14],
   "radius": 3,
   "speaker": "HULL",
   "text": "The bow. Singers across the gap, a flyer over it. The plate throws you to the gimbal. You have time to shoot on the way."
  },
  {
   "id": "gimbal",
   "at": [74, 33],
   "radius": 3,
   "speaker": "INES",
   "text": "Rings inside rings. Everything here is a different world. The hub has the fuse, and so does whatever guards it."
